      <tr><td>Hot-weather periods</td><td>Heat and UV warnings</td><td>Limit heat exposure, carry water and identify a suitable rest alternative.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Rainy periods</td><td>Rain, thunderstorms, drainage and path condition</td><td>Postpone exposed plans when necessary and follow official instructions.</td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div><p class="credits">Seasonal preparation never extends gate hours or confirms facility operation. Observe any wildlife from a distance and do not feed it.</p>
