till handles technical HTTP connection and request data at its edge to deliver and secure these pages. Hosting-side traffic statistics and security/network reporting are separate from browser-beacon measurements and do not require that script to run. This page has no control for those hosting processes.</p><p>The embedded map contacts Google when loaded. Photos, styles and icons on this version are local. The server requests Open-Meteo using fixed Lahore coordinates, not your device location; the page does not request geolocation. Opening external links contacts those providers.</p></section>
